  "review_notes": [
    "Exact OBS1 ELF only; changed images require callback/table/stack review.",
    "rp1.c dispatch: get_status=status, get_features=features, notify=notify; all other dispatch members NULL.",
    "rpmsg device ops set by pinned rpmsg_init_vdev_with_config; endpoint callbacks received and NS callback only.",
    "state and _metal zeroed; release_cb, NS unbind/bind, notify_wait and metal io custom ops remain NULL.",
    "Rust BLX literal targets are encode_hex_u32, emit_state3_trace_u16 and record_snapshot.",
    "Table bounds guarded by CMP/BHI; Op has5 valid Rust variants; State has4. SCMI command4..7 subtracted4.",
    "Count fixed allocation sites including str predecrement and conservative full caller frames; require no growing CFG cycle.",
    "PSP68 = basic exception32 + alignment4 + PendSV32; reserve8 top alignment and at least128 remaining.",
    "MSP conservatively adds cold startup to every reviewed kernel/SCMI path and two stackless fault/NMI frames; only reviewed fixed MSP pivots and PSP context restores are admitted.",
    "Cold initial vector MSP F000; Reset masks IRQ and fills E000..F000, first-task trampoline reloads MSP from owned VTOR[0] before SVC.",
    "OBS1 admission reads both C0 ISER/IABR banks and IPSR and refuses any enabled/active external IRQ; it never clears foreign pending bits."
  ],
